{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51381","headline":"龙虎山 · 吴武陵","name":"龙虎山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙虎山中紫翠烟，青精颜色四时妍。\n桃枝惯见花成实，瀛岛宜闻海变田。\n五斗米仙真有道，一神楼药岂无缘。\n秋风吹绿茂陵草，的的黄金飞上天。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一四七《龙虎山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}